WEBVTT

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:04.780
We will now begin the 57th
expedition beyond the walls!

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.720
Onward!

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:18.429
The Survey Corps left to find a route to
Zhiganshina, but encountered a Female Titan,

00:00:18.429 --> 00:00:21.667
a transformed human like Eren.

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:29.770
That's no Aberrant.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.898
It's a human in the body of a Titan!

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.530
As soldiers died, one after the next,

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.545
they headed into a
forest of giant trees,

00:00:46.571 --> 00:00:49.338
none of them knowing why.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.930
If Squad Levi doesn't
defeat it, who will?

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:55.560
Choose.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.810
Believe in yourself.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.890
Or believe in the Survey Corps and me.

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:05.940
I'll go forward!

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:13.150
Fire!

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:20.280
Oh, right...

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:22.720
I wanted to ask you something.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:27.250
Is it okay if we cut off
your hands and legs?

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.850
They'll grow back, right?

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:33.050
I'm talking about <i>your</i>
limbs, not the Titan's.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:37.350
We need you alive, after all...

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:52.490
The enemy was willing
to sacrifice everything.

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:56.490
I didn't expect the enemy to destroy
itself along with the evidence

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.430
by making Titans devour itself.

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.600
Retreat, men!

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.060
Back into formation!

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.130
Return to Karanes!

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:14.880
Erwin...

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.880
Why did you order Levi to resupply?

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:17.970
There's no time to waste.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.170
The Female Titan was eaten.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:23.870
But did you see the
person inside get eaten?

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.010
I didn't.

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.040
You can't mean...

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:27.810
Yes...

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.650
If your original hypothesis was correct,

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:34.670
and they can still move to a degree
after regaining human form...

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:39.910
And if they'd equipped
Maneuver Gear in advance...

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:45.710
The one within the Female Titan
is wearing our uniform right now.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.420
Captain Levi?

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.950
No, it's not!

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:50.630
Who are you?!

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:57.840
Gunther!

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:09.600
The enemy is now camouflaged
as one of our men.

00:04:38.093 --> 00:04:41.688
Sync and corrections by masaca
- addic7ed.com -

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:47.410
Crushing Blow
57th Expedition Beyond the Walls (5)

00:04:49.698 --> 00:04:52.861
When the Colossal Titan vanished,

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:57.090
whoever was inside had been
wearing Maneuver Gear,

00:04:57.090 --> 00:04:59.670
so that they could escape in the steam.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:03.050
Don't you think the same
possibility applies here?

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.800
But at the time...

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:08.010
Based on what we saw when Eren
emerged from the Titan,

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.600
we concluded it would be impossible.

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:15.390
His equipment was destroyed,
and his uniform was gone.

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:21.350
Above all, Eren was so weak,
he couldn't even stand unassisted.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:27.640
The Female Titan was able to
attract other Titans with its cry.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:31.700
We failed to predict this,
and the operation failed.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.200
If Titan abilities vary
depending on skill,

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:40.110
it was a mistake to use Eren, a total
novice, as the basis for our assumptions.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:45.860
If we are to outwit our enemy,
we'll need to think outside the box.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.260
If we're withdrawing, does that
mean the mission succeeded?

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:58.370
If so, then we may already know who
was inside the Female Titan.

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.100
I'd like to see who it is...

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.960
But why was the Commander so sure

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.480
that the enemy would come after
Eren if he left the walls?

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:10.530
I think it's because, for some reason,

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:14.140
they suddenly stopped their advance
in the midst of the last assault.

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:18.200
Even though they managed
to break through Trost's gate,

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.870
they didn't even try for the inner gate.

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:24.040
And when Eren sealed
the gate, they let him.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:29.690
It could mean that they now
have bigger concerns...

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.680
Bigger concerns?

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:35.720
Something more important to
them than breaching the walls.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:38.470
Something unexpected that happened.

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:41.560
Eren's transformation into a Titan?!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.270
I think it's the only answer.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.030
Then... That means...

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.190
Wait... So...

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:53.360
Someone who was there,
who saw Eren transform,

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.740
is the Titan.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:06:59.830
Gunther!

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.950
Eren, don't stop!

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:03.210
Onward!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.210
But Gunther...

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.500
Who's there?

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.550
Protect Eren!

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.380
Damn it, what do we do?

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.340
Eldo, where should we go?

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.300
There isn't time to reach the horses!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.260
Head for HQ, as fast as you can!

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.610
Is it from the Female Titan?
Or is there more than one?

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:29.400
Damn you...

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.480
How dare you?!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.320
Come at me!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.860
I'll defeat you, even if it kills me!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.570
The Female Titan?

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.450
Impossible... Why?

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:39.870
Didn't we catch it?!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:52.460
If the enemy has some way
to retain its strength,

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.180
it may be able to transform once more.

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:02.890
I knew it...

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:03.890
It's coming!

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:06.020
The Female Titan!

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:15.320
Damn you...

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.320
How dare you!

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.740
This time, I will defeat it!

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:19.530
No!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:23.660
The three of us will
kill the Female Titan.

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:26.790
You will continue to head
straight for HQ at top speed!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.590
Here's what I have gleaned
from this battle...

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.900
If we only focus on
making the best moves,

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:37.550
we will never get the
better of our opponent.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:40.840
When necessary, we must be
willing to take big risks,

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:43.720
and be prepared to lose everything.

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:45.480
I'll fight, too!

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:46.230
No!

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.310
This is the best move...

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:50.480
Your power is too risky!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:54.020
What? Do you doubt us?

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:55.840
Do you, Eren?

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:59.570
Do you find it that hard to trust us?

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:03.870
Unless we change how we fight,

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.020
humanity cannot win!

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.140
I believe my squad will be victorious.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:17.880
Good luck!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.410
We took its sight.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.080
For at least a minute,
it'll be in total darkness!

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.330
Kill it during this time!

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.670
Screw capturing it...

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:53.460
Kill it now!

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.750
Die here without honor!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.500
Make that bitch of a Titan pay!

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:02.430
We won't let your eyes regenerate!

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:19.070
We'll shear off so much muscle
around your shoulders,

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:21.650
you won't be able to keep your arms up!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.080
Shear it off...

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.500
Make its arms...

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.660
fall!

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:34.830
They're down!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.500
Now the neck!

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:41.220
Shear off the muscles
that support its neck!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.880
And we can strike its weak point!

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.180
They're so strong.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.390
The Female Titan is
totally on the defensive.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:56.060
How can they launch co-op attacks like that
without even speaking to each other?

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:00.680
I bet it's only possible because
they believe in one another.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.720
They've overcome many
hardships that way.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:07.570
That's why they're so strong,
even right after losing Gunther.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:12.200
I'll go forward...

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:16.190
If I go forward and believe in them,
without turning back, then...

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.900
I'm sure that's the right answer.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.970
I finally understand!

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.340
I don't know...

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.690
I never have.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.100
I can believe in my own abilities

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:32.270
or the choices of companions I trust.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.230
But no one ever knows
how it will turn out.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:42.360
Strike the neck, now!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.460
Eldo!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:56.710
H-How?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.670
It can't possibly see!

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.840
It hasn't even been thirty seconds...

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:03.890
Only one eye?

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.840
It prioritized one eye
to accelerate the healing...

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:09.180
Is that even possible?

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:10.930
Petra!

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:12.390
We need to regroup!

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:16.230
Petra, now!

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:26.950
Hey...

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.530
Die!

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:35.750
How?

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.750
My blade can't pierce it...

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.520
I...

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.770
I will...

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:06.240
I'll kill it!

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:23.010
Eren?

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.090
Wait, what? Mikasa?

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.420
That voice... Don't tell me...

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:47.883
I made the wrong choice...

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:52.490
I wanted to believe in my companions...

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.710
Because of that, everyone died!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:08.960
If I had believed in myself
from the start and fought...

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:13.800
If I'd only killed it at the beginning!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.320
Back then,

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.390
if I'd turned into a Titan...

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:38.530
No...

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.910
If I'd fought

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.950
even before that...

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.800
Captain Levi was there, too.

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:50.830
We would have won.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:53.590
Maybe we could've captured it.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.710
You aren't wrong.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:57.930
lf you want to, do it.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.380
I...

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.600
I made a choice.

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:10.070
And it killed everyone.

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:14.230
It's my fault they died.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:19.820
But despite all that...

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.120
It's still your fault!

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:36.340
I'll tear you apart...

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:39.380
Once my hand heals,

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:43.640
I'll rip you apart...
Tear you to shreds...

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:47.180
Rip you into tiny pieces...

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.390
And eat you!

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:51.220
Eren!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:16.430
W-Wait... Eren...

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:23.810
Don't go...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.770
Give...

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.600
Give...

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.560
Give Eren back!

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.420
Give him back!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.730
Give him back!

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:16.060
Why won't my blade penetrate?

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:19.710
I know that

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.060
he's alive...

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.860
I know that Eren's alive!

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:30.030
No matter where she goes, I'll kill her,

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:32.450
rip her apart,

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:35.790
and get you out of that filth.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.080
I'm sorry, Eren...

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:42.380
Just wait a little longer...

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:50.840
Wait!

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:52.760
Wh-What are you...

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.570
Fall back for now.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.210
Maintain this distance.

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.420
It may be tired.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.680
It does not appear to
be going very fast.

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:12.950
He seems to have been bit
right out of the neck.

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:14.950
Is Eren dead?

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:54.590
"Eren is alive."

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:56.340
"Give Eren back."

00:23:57.030 --> 00:24:00.540
The Female Titan took Eren from
Mikasa before her very eyes.

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:03.820
Mikasa joins forces with humanity's
strongest fighter, Levi,

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:05.910
to challenge the Female Titan to battle.

00:24:05.910 --> 00:24:13.910
The Defeated
57th Expedition Beyond the Walls (6)
